OL,3,GNEWSAArson-hit former hotel to be
OL,4,A'urgently demolished'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to "urgently" demolish a derelict
OL,7,Fhotel repeatedly targeted by arsonists
OL,8,Fand replace it with 55 new homes have
OL,9,Fbeen approved.
OL,11,FCity council planners agreed to let
OL,12,Fdevelopers Avant Homes go ahead with
OL,13,Fknocking down the vacant Allesley Hotel
OL,14,Fbuilding in Birmingham Road, Coventry,
OL,15,Fbefore specific details are approved.
OL,17,FCouncillors had voted unanimously in
OL,18,Ffavour of the demolition of the hotel
OL,19,Fearlier this year, which has remained
OL,20,Fempty since 2022.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
