OL,3,GNEWSAArson-hit former hotel to be
OL,4,A'urgently demolished'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Salt, regional planning manager at
OL,7,FAvant Homes, said the need to go ahead
OL,8,Fswiftly with clearing the site had
OL,9,Farisen because of the state of the
OL,10,Fexisting buildings.
